## Definition

A reified record of one change to a vocabulary term in a given release — a first\-class information object carrying a version \(gmeow:entryVersion\) and optional prose \(gmeow:entryNote\)\. Attached to a term through the gmeow:hasChangelogEntry annotation, so a term accrues an ordered per\-release history without any per\-instance lifecycle modelling\.

